o chat conversation with other people in the user’s organization."},description:{id:"rovo-conversation-sharing.share-conversation-modal.description",defaultMessage:"People with the link can view messages sent up to this moment and start their own chat. Future messages won’t be shared.",description:"Sentence shown below the modal title explaining what is shared when the current chat is shared — only the snapshot up to this point, not future messages."},seeWhatOthersCanSeeLink:{id:"rovo-conversation-sharing.share-conversation-modal.see-what-others-can-see-link",defaultMessage:"See what others can see",description:"Inline link, shown after the modal description, that opens a preview of exactly what other people will be able to view if the chat is shared with them."},visibilityGroupLabel:{id:"rovo-conversation-sharing.share-conversation-modal.visibility-group-label",defaultMessage:"Who can view this chat snapshot",description:"Accessible group label announced for the pair of visibility options (“Visible to everyone in {org}” vs. “Only visible to specific people”) inside the share-snapshot modal. Read by screen readers when focus enters the option list."},orgOptionTitle:{id:"rovo-conversation-sharing.share-conversation-modal.org-option-title",defaultMessage:"Visible to everyone in your organization",description:"Title of the first visibility option in the share-snapshot modal — used when the user’s organization name is not known. Selecting this option means anyone in the user’s organization with the link can view the chat snapshot."},orgOptionTitleWithName:{id:"rovo-conversation-sharing.share-conversation-modal.org-option-title-with-name",defaultMessage:"Visible to everyone within {orgName}",description:"Title of the first visibility option in the share-snapshot modal when the user’s organization name is known. {orgName} is the name of the user’s organization. Selecting this option means anyone in that organization with the link can view the chat snapshot."},orgOptionSubtitle:{id:"rovo-conversation-sharing.share-conversation-modal.org-option-subtitle",defaultMessage:"Anyone in your org with the link can view",description:"Helper text shown beneath the first visibility option title in the share-snapshot modal, explaining that anyone in the user’s organization who has the link will be able to view the shared chat snapshot."},specificPeopleOptionTitle:{id:"rovo-conversation-sharing.share-conversation-modal.specific-people-option-title",defaultMessage:"Only visible to specific people",description:"Title of the second visibility option in the share-snapshot modal. Selecting this option lets the user pick specific people in a user picker — only those people will be able to view the shared chat snapshot."},specificPeopleOptionSubtitle:{id:"rovo-conversation-sharing.share-conversation-modal.specific-people-option-subtitle",defaultMessage:"Choose who can view this chat snapshot",description:"Default helper text shown beneath the second visibility option title in the share-snapshot modal, before the user has added anyone. Tells the user that selecting this option lets them choose exactly who can view the shared chat snapshot."},specificAccessSectionTitle:{id:"rovo-conversation-sharing.share-conversation-modal.specific-access-section-title",defaultMessage:"Specific access",description:"Heading for the section that summarizes specific people who can view the shared chat snapshot."},peopleWithAccessSummaryCurrentUserAndOne:{id:"rovo-conversation-sharing.share-conversation-modal.people-with-access-summary-current-user-and-one",defaultMessage:"{ownerName} and {name}",description:"Summary text shown when the current user and one other person have access to the chat snapshot. {ownerName} is the formatted display name of the current user, for example “Cory McCullough (You)”. {name} is the other person’s display name."},peopleWithAccessSummaryCurrentUserAndMany:{id:"rovo-conversation-sharing.share-conversation-modal.people-with-access-summary-current-user-and-many",defaultMessage:"{ownerName}, {name}, and {count, plural, one {# other} other {# others}}",description:"Summary text shown when the current user, one named person, and multiple other people have access to the chat snapshot. {ownerName} is the formatted display name of the current user, for example “Cory McCullough (You)”. {name} is the first other person’s display name. {count} is the number of remaining people."},ownerAccessDisplayName:{id:"rovo-conversation-sharing.share-conversation-modal.owner-access-display-name",defaultMessage:"{name} (You)",description:"Display name shown for the current user in the specific access section of the share-snapshot modal. {name} is the current user’s full display name."},currentUserAccessLabel:{id:"rovo-conversation-sharing.share-conversation-modal.current-user-access-label",defaultMessage:"You",description:"Fallback label shown for the current user in the specific access section when their full display name has not loaded yet."},peopleWithAccessOverflowLabel:{id:"rovo-conversation-sharing.share-conversation-modal.people-with-access-overflow-label",defaultMessage:"+{count}",description:"Short label shown in the avatar stack when more people have access than can be shown as individual avatars. {count} is the number of additional people."},showPeopleWithAccessLabel:{id:"rovo-conversation-sharing.share-conversation-modal.show-people-with-access-label",defaultMessage:"Show people with access",description:"Accessible label for the button that expands the list of people who can view the shared chat snapshot."},hidePeopleWithAccessLabel:{id:"rovo-conversation-sharing.share-conversation-modal.hide-people-with-access-label",defaultMessage:"Hide people with access",description:"Accessible label for the button that collapses the list of people who can view the shared chat snapshot."},peopleWithAccessRegionLabel:{id:"rovo-conversation-sharing.share-conversation-modal.people-with-access-region-label",defaultMessage:"People with access",description:"Accessible label for the expanded region that lists the people who can view the shared chat snapshot."},removePersonAccessLabel:{id:"rovo-conversation-sharing.share-conversation-modal.remove-person-access-label",defaultMessage:"Remove access for {name}",description:"Accessible label for the remove button next to a person in the specific-people sharing access list. {name} is the display name of the person whose access will be removed."},removingPersonAccessLabel:{id:"rovo-conversation-sharing.share-conversation-modal.removing-person-access-label",defaultMessage:"Removing access for {name}",description:"Accessible label for the loading spinner shown next to a person in the specific-people sharing access list while that person’s access is being removed. {name} is the display name of the person whose access is being removed."},loadingInitialStateLabel:{id:"rovo-conversation-sharing.share-conversation-modal.loading-initial-state-label",defaultMessage:"Loading share settings",description:"Accessible label for the loading spinner shown while the share-snapshot modal loads the existing access settings for the chat."},userPickerPlaceholder:{id:"rovo-conversation-sharing.share-conversation-modal.user-picker-placeholder",defaultMessage:"Search by name or email",description:"Placeholder text shown inside the user picker input when no people have been selected yet, prompting the user to start typing a name or email to search for the person they want to share with."},userPickerNoOptionsMessage:{id:"rovo-conversation-sharing.share-conversation-modal.user-picker-no-options-message",defaultMessage:"No people found",description:"Message shown inside the user picker’s dropdown when the typeahead search does not return any matching people for what the user has typed."},primaryButtonLabel:{id:"rovo-conversation-sharing.share-conversation-modal.primary-button-label",defaultMessage:"Generate link",description:"Label on the primary button at the bottom of the share-snapshot modal. When clicked, it generates a shareable link to the current chat snapshot with the visibility the user has chosen."},shareLinkFieldLabel:{id:"rovo-conversation-sharing.share-conversation-modal.share-link-field-label",defaultMessage:"Shareable link to this chat snapshot",description:"Accessible label for the read-only text field that shows the generated shareable link, displayed in the share-snapshot modal after a link has been created. Read by screen readers so the user knows the field contains the link they can copy."},previewButtonLabel:{id:"rovo-conversation-sharing.share-conversation-modal.preview-button-label",defaultMessage:"Preview",description:"Label on the secondary button shown in the share-snapshot modal after a shareable link has been created. When clicked, it opens a preview of what other people can see in the shared chat snapshot."},copyLinkButtonLabel:{id:"rovo-conversation-sharing.share-conversation-modal.copy-link-button-label",defaultMessage:"Copy link",description:"Label on the button that creates the shareable link if needed, then copies it to the user’s clipboard."},copyingLinkButtonLabel:{id:"rovo-conversation-sharing.share-conversation-modal.copying-link-button-label",defaultMessage:"Copying link...",description:"Temporary label on the Copy link button while the shareable link is being copied to the user’s clipboard."},copyLinkConfirmationLabel:{id:"rovo-conversation-sharing.share-conversation-modal.copy-link-confirmation-label",defaultMessage:"Link copied!",description:"Temporary label that replaces the “Copy link” button label for a couple of seconds immediately after the user copies the shareable link to their clipboard, confirming the copy succeeded before reverting back to “Copy link”."},accessChangedFlagTitle:{id:"rovo-conversation-sharing.share-conversation-modal.access-changed-flag-title",defaultMessage:"Access updated",description:"Title of the success notification flag shown after share snapshot access is created or updated."},maxPeopleExceededError:{id:"rovo-conversation-sharing.share-conversation-modal.max-people-exceeded-error",defaultMessage:"Cannot share with more than {limit} specific users. Consider sharing with the whole organization instead.",description:"Inline error shown in the share-snapshot modal when saving the share failed because the recipient list exceeds the maximum number of people a single share supports. {limit} is that maximum."},maxSharesExceededError:{id:"rovo-conversation-sharing.share-conversation-modal.max-shares-exceeded-error",defaultMessage:"Cannot create more than {limit} shares for a conversation. Delete an existing share before creating a new one.",description:"Inline error shown in the share-snapshot modal when creating a new share failed because the chat has already reached the maximum number of shares. {limit} is that maximum."},copyLinkFailedError:{id:"rovo-conversation-sharing.share-conversation-modal.copy-link-failed-error",defaultMessage:"Copying the link failed. Try again, or manually copy it from below.",description:"Inline warning shown in the share-snapshot modal when the share was created successfully but the browser refused to write the link to the clipboard, so the user has nothing pasted. Tells them they can retry the copy action, or select and copy by hand the link shown below the warning."},manageSharedChatsAction:{id:"rovo-conversation-sharing.share-conversation-modal.manage-shared-chats-action",defaultMessage:"Manage shared chats",description:'Label for the action shown beneath the maximum-shares error in the share-snapshot modal. Choosing it closes the share dialog and opens the "Shared chats" settings screen, where the user can delete links they created earlier.'},footerWithOrgName:{id:"rovo-conversation-sharing.share-conversation-modal.footer-with-org-name",defaultMessage:"Only visible to members of {orgName}. Your chat memory will not be shared.",description:"Privacy footer message inside the share-snapshot modal. Reassures t